+    /// The store's manifest, without opening the store.
+    ///
+    /// Opening ([`Segments::open`]) is what a *process* comes in by: it creates the segment
+    /// directory, flushes it, finishes whatever a crash left behind and checks every file the
+    /// manifest names. None of that belongs to a tool that was handed a store to read —
